{"unit_id": "tag:01IG:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>为环（ring）。设<MATH_0002>为理想（ideal）。考虑仿射概形（affine schemes）之间的态射（morphism）<MATH_0003>。由代数（Algebra）一章的引理<REF_0001>，这是将<MATH_0004>映到<MATH_0005>的一个闭子集（closed subset）上的同胚（homeomorphism）。此外，若<MATH_0006>是对应于点（point）<MATH_0007>的素理想（prime），且<MATH_0008>，<MATH_0009>，则在茎（stalks）上得到映射（map）<MATH_0010>。因此，<MATH_0011>是局部环化空间（locally ringed spaces）的闭浸入（closed immersion），见定义<REF_0002>。显然，它与拟凝聚理想层（quasi-coherent sheaf of ideals）<MATH_0012>所确定的闭子空间（closed subspace）（同构（isomorphic）），见例<REF_0003>。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "ring", "target_term": "环"}, {"source_term": "ideal", "target_term": "理想"}, {"source_term": "affine schemes", "target_term": "仿射概形"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "Algebra", "target_term": "代数"}, {"source_term": "closed subset", "target_term": "闭子集"}, {"source_term": "homeomorphism", "target_term": "同胚"}, {"source_term": "point", "target_term": "点"}, {"source_term": "prime", "target_term": "素理想"}, {"source_term": "stalks", "target_term": "茎"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "locally ringed spaces", "target_term": "局部环化空间"}, {"source_term": "closed immersion", "target_term": "闭浸入"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent sheaf of ideals", "target_term": "拟凝聚理想层"}, {"source_term": "closed subspace", "target_term": "闭子空间"}, {"source_term": "isomorphic", "target_term": "同构"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "ring", "target_term": "环", "context": "例中的基环"}, {"source_term": "ideal", "target_term": "理想", "context": "例中的商环所用理想"}, {"source_term": "affine schemes", "target_term": "仿射概形", "context": "态射两端的对象"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "例中考察的态射"}, {"source_term": "Algebra", "target_term": "代数", "context": "所引章节的名称"}, {"source_term": "closed subset", "target_term": "闭子集", "context": "同胚的像"}, {"source_term": "homeomorphism", "target_term": "同胚", "context": "底层空间上的同胚"}, {"source_term": "point",