{"unit_id": "tag:01IH:statement", "translation": "<LOCKED_0001>\n设<MATH_0001>为仿射概形（affine scheme）。设<MATH_0002>为任意一个局部环化空间（locally ringed spaces）的闭浸入（closed immersion）。则存在唯一的理想（ideal）<MATH_0003>，使得态射（morphism）<MATH_0004>可与闭浸入（closed immersion）<MATH_0005>相识别，后者在上面的例<REF_0001>中构造。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "affine scheme", "target_term": "仿射概形"}, {"source_term": "locally ringed spaces", "target_term": "局部环化空间"}, {"source_term": "closed immersion", "target_term": "闭浸入"}, {"source_term": "ideal", "target_term": "理想"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "closed immersion", "target_term": "闭浸入"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "affine scheme", "target_term": "仿射概形", "context": "闭浸入的靶"}, {"source_term": "locally ringed spaces", "target_term": "局部环化空间", "context": "引理所处的范畴"}, {"source_term": "closed immersion", "target_term": "闭浸入", "context": "任意给定的闭浸入"}, {"source_term": "ideal", "target_term": "理想", "context": "存在且唯一的理想"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "待识别的给定态射"}, {"source_term": "closed immersion", "target_term": "闭浸入", "context": "前例构造的闭浸入"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:01IH:proof", "translation": "这有点儿过于简单了！具体地，由引理<REF_0001>，可以把<MATH_0001>与理想层（sheaf of ideals）<MATH_0002>所确定的闭子空间（closed subspace）相识别，如定义<REF_0002>和例<REF_0003>所述。按我们的约定，该理想层（sheaf of ideals）作为一个层（sheaf）（取值于<MATH_0003>-模（modules）），局部由截面生成（locally generated by sections）。因此，商（quotient）层（sheaf）<MATH_0004>在<MATH_0005>上局部是映射（map）<MATH_0006>的余核（cokernel）。于是按定义，<MATH_0007>是拟凝聚的（quasi-coherent）。由第<REF_0004>节的结果，它具有形式<MATH_0008>，其中所用的<MATH_0009>-模（module）为某个<MATH_0010>。此外，由于<MATH_0011>是满射（surjective），由引理<REF_0005>可知<MATH_0012>也是拟凝聚的（quasi-coherent），设其为<MATH_0013>。当然，<MATH_0014>且<MATH_0015>，一切就清楚了。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "sheaf of ideals", "target_term": "理想层"}, {"source_term": "closed subspace", "target_term": "闭子空间"}, {"source_term": "sheaf of ideals", "target_term": "理想层"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "modules", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "locally generated by sections", "target_term": "局部由截面生成"}, {"source_term": "quotient", "target_term": "商"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "cokernel", "target_term": "余核"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent", "target_term": "拟凝聚的"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "surjective", "target_term": "满射"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent", "target_term": "拟凝聚的"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "sheaf of ideals", "target_term": "理想层", "context": "与闭子空间关联的理想层"}, {"source_term": "closed subspace", "target_term": "闭子空间", "context": "与给定对象相识别的子空间"}, {"source_term": "sheaf of ideals", "target_term": "理想层", "context": "应用局部生成约定的理想层"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层", "context": "模取值的层"}, {"source_term": "modules", "target_term": "模", "context": "层的代数结构"}, {"source_term": "locally generated by sections", "target_term": "局部由截面生成", "context": "理想层的局部生成条件"}, {"source_term": "quotient", "target_term": "商", "context": "对层取商"}, {"source_term"