{"unit_id": "tag:01IJ:statement", "translation": "<LOCKED_0001>\n<TEXTITOPEN_0001>概形（scheme）<TEXTITCLOSE_0001>是满足下述性质的局部环化空间（locally ringed space）：每一点（point）都有一个开邻域（open neighbourhood），它是仿射概形（affine scheme）。<TEXTITOPEN_0002>概形态射（morphism of schemes）<TEXTITCLOSE_0002>是局部环化空间（locally ringed spaces）的态射（morphism）。由概形（schemes）构成的范畴（category）记作<MATH_0001>。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "locally ringed space", "target_term": "局部环化空间"}, {"source_term": "point", "target_term": "点"}, {"source_term": "open neighbourhood", "target_term": "开邻域"}, {"source_term": "affine scheme", "target_term": "仿射概形"}, {"source_term": "morphism of schemes", "target_term": "概形态射"}, {"source_term": "locally ringed spaces", "target_term": "局部环化空间"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "category", "target_term": "范畴"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "定义的对象"}, {"source_term": "locally ringed space", "target_term": "局部环化空间", "context": "概形的底层结构"}, {"source_term": "point", "target_term": "点", "context": "局部条件所量化的对象"}, {"source_term": "open neighbourhood", "target_term": "开邻域", "context": "定义所要求的邻域"}, {"source_term": "affine scheme", "target_term": "仿射概形", "context": "开邻域所具有的结构"}, {"source_term": "morphism of schemes", "target_term": "概形态射", "context": "定义的态射"}, {"source_term": "locally ringed spaces", "target_term": "局部环化空间", "context": "态射两端的结构"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "概形态射所用的概念"}, {"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形", "context": "该范畴的对象"}, {"source_term": "category", "target_term": "范畴", "context": "给定记号的范畴"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:01II:prose-0001", "translation": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n设<MATH_0001>为概形（scheme）。我们将采用下述（极轻微的）术语滥用（abuse of language）：我们称<MATH_0002>为<TEXTITOPEN_0001>仿射开集（affine open）<TEXTITCLOSE_0001>，或<TEXTITOPEN_0002>开仿射集（open affine）<TEXTITCLOSE_0002>，条件是开子空间（open subspace）<MATH_0003>是仿射概形（affine scheme）。我们常写作<MATH_0004>，表示<MATH_0005>与<MATH_0006>同构（isomorphic），并且我们将（暂时）把<MATH_0007>和<MATH_0008>相识别。\n\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "abuse of language", "target_term": "术语滥用"}, {"source_term": "affine open", "target_term": "仿射开集"}, {"source_term": "open affine", "target_term": "开仿射集"}, {"source_term": "open subspace", "target_term": "开子空间"}, {"source_term": "affine scheme", "target_term": "仿射概形"}, {"source_term": "isomorphic", "target_term": "同构"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "段落中固定的对象"}, {"source_term": "abuse of language", "target_term": "术语滥用", "context": "原文说明惯用叫法的用语"}, {"source_term": "affine open", "target_term": "仿射开集", "context": "命名仿射的开子空间的第一种叫法"}, {"source_term": "open affine", "target_term": "开仿射集", "context": "命名同类对象的另一种叫法"}, {"source_term": "open subspace", "target_term": "开子空间", "context": "仿射条件所指的子空间"}, {"source_term": "affine scheme", "target_term": "仿射概形", "context": "命名条件所要求的概形"}, {"source_term": "isomorphic", "target_term": "同构", "context": "常用写法表达的对象关系"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:01IK:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>为概形（scheme）。设<MATH_0002>为局部环化空间（locally ringed spaces）的开浸入（open immersion）。则<MATH_0003>是概形（scheme）。特别地，<MATH_0004>的任意开子空间（open subspace）都是概形（scheme）。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "locally ringed spaces", "target_term": "局部环化空间"}, {"source_term": "open immersion", "target_term": "开浸入"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "open subspace", "target_term": "开子空间"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "给定的概形"}, {"source_term": "locally ringed spaces", "target_term": "局部环化空间", "context": "开浸入的对象类型"}, {"source_term": "open immersion", "target_term": "开浸入", "context": "引理的假设"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "引理的一般结论"}, {"source_term": "open subspace", "target_term": "开子空间", "context": "特别情形的子空间"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "特别情形所得的对象"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:01IK:proof", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>。设<MATH_0002>。取一个仿射开集（affine open）邻域（neighbourhood）<MATH_0003>。由于<MATH_0004>的标准开集（standard opens）构成<MATH_0005>上拓扑（topology）的一组基（basis），可知存在<MATH_0006>，使得<MATH_0007>。而<MATH_0008>是仿射概形（affine scheme），这是引理<REF_0001>的结论。这就证明了<MATH_0009>的每一点（point）都有一个仿射的（affine）开（open）邻域（neighbourhood）。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "affine open", "target_term": "仿射开集"}, {"source_term": "neighbourhood", "target_term": "邻域"}, {"source_term": "standard opens", "target_term": "标准开集"}, {"source_term": "topology", "target_term": "拓扑"}, {"source_term": "basis", "target_term": "基"}, {"source_term": "affine scheme", "target_term": "仿射概形"}, {"source_term": "point", "target_term": "点"}, {"source_term": "affine", "target_term": "仿射的"}, {"source_term": "open", "target_term": "开"}, {"source_term": "neighbourhood", "target_term": "邻域"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "affine open", "target_term": "仿射开集", "context": "所选邻域的类型"}, {"source_term": "neighbourhood", "target_term": "邻域", "context": "所选对象相对于给定点的性质"}, {"source_term": "standard opens", "target_term": "标准开集", "context": "构成基的开集"}, {"source_term": "topology", "target_term": "拓扑", "context": "基所属的拓扑"}, {"source_term": "basis", "target_term": "基", "context": "标准开集所构成的族"}, {"source_term": "affine scheme", "target_term": "仿射概形", "context": "由所引引理得到的性质"}, {"source_term": "point", "target_term": "点", "context": "结论中的任意点"}, {"source_term": "affine", "target_term": "仿射的", "context": "所得到的开邻域的性质"}, {"source_term": "open", "target_term": "开", "context": "修饰结论中的邻域"}, {"source_term": "neighbourhood", "target_term": "邻域", "context": "每个点所具有的邻域"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:01II:prose-0002", "translation": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n显然，该引理（或其证明）表明，任意概形（scheme）<MATH_0001>都有一组基（basis）（见拓扑（Topology）一章第<REF_0001>节），它是由仿射开集（affine opens）组成的拓扑（topology）基。\n\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "basis", "target_term": "基"}, {"source_term": "Topology", "target_term": "拓扑"}, {"source_term": "affine opens", "target_term": "仿射开集"}, {"source_term": "topology", "target_term": "拓扑"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "结论适用的任意对象"}, {"source_term": "basis", "target_term": "基", "context": "引理所给出的基"}, {"source_term": "Topology", "target_term": "拓扑", "context": "所引章节的名称"}, {"source_term": "affine opens", "target_term": "仿射开集", "context": "组成基的开集"}, {"source_term": "topology", "target_term": "拓扑", "context": "该基所属的结构"}], "notes": []}
