{"unit_id": "tag:01IM:prose-0001", "translation": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n在引理<REF_0001>中，我们看到概形（scheme）的任意开子空间（open subspace）都是概形（scheme）。下面我们将证明，这对概形（scheme）的闭子空间（closed subspace）同样成立。\n\n<STRUCT_0002><STRUCT_0003>\n注意，<MATH_0001>-模（modules）的拟凝聚层（quasi-coherent sheaf）这一概念对任意环化空间（ringed space）<MATH_0002>都有定义，特别是当<MATH_0003>为概形（scheme）时。由第<REF_0002>节的结果可知，这样的层（sheaf）在任意仿射开集（affine open）<MATH_0004>上都具有形式<MATH_0005>，其中所用的<MATH_0006>-模（module）为某个<MATH_0007>。\n\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "open subspace", "target_term": "开子空间"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "closed subspace", "target_term": "闭子空间"}, {"source_term": "modules", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent sheaf", "target_term": "拟凝聚层"}, {"source_term": "ringed space", "target_term": "环化空间"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "affine open", "target_term": "仿射开集"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "开子空间的环境空间"}, {"source_term": "open subspace", "target_term": "开子空间", "context": "已有引理涉及的对象"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "已有引理得出的性质"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "闭子空间的环境空间"}, {"source_term": "closed subspace", "target_term": "闭子空间", "context": "下文将考察的对象"}, {"source_term": "modules", "target_term": "模", "context": "构成拟凝聚层的代数对象"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent sheaf", "target_term": "拟凝聚层", "context": "在环化空间上定义的概念"}, {"source_term": "ringed space", "target_term": "环化空间", "context": "拟凝聚层的定义环境"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "特别指出的一类环化空间"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层", "context": "讨论局部形式的对象"}, {"source_term": "affine open", "target_term": "仿射开集", "context": "所述局部形式成立的开集"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模", "context": "给出所述局部形式的对象"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:01IN:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>为概形（scheme）。设<MATH_0002>为局部环化空间（locally ringed spaces）的闭浸入（closed immersion）。\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002>局部环化空间（locally ringed space）<MATH_0003>是概形（scheme），\n<STRUCT_0003><MATH_0004>是映射（map）<MATH_0005>的核（kernel），且是拟凝聚理想层（quasi-coherent sheaf of ideals），\n<STRUCT_0004>对任意仿射开集（affine open）<MATH_0006>（它是<MATH_0007>的开集），态射（morphism）<MATH_0008>可与<MATH_0009>相识别，其中用到某个理想（ideal）<MATH_0010>，且\n<STRUCT_0005>有<MATH_0011>。\n<STRUCT_0006>\n特别地，任何局部由截面生成（locally generated by sections）的理想层（sheaf of ideals）都是拟凝聚理想层（quasi-coherent sheaf of ideals）（反之亦然），且<MATH_0012>的任意闭子空间（closed subspace）都是概形（scheme）。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "locally ringed spaces", "target_term": "局部环化空间"}, {"source_term": "closed immersion", "target_term": "闭浸入"}, {"source_term": "locally ringed space", "target_term": "局部环化空间"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "kernel", "target_term": "核"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent sheaf of ideals", "target_term": "拟凝聚理想层"}, {"source_term": "affine open", "target_term": "仿射开集"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "ideal", "target_term": "理想"}, {"source_term": "locally generated by sections", "target_term": "局部由截面生成"}, {"source_term": "sheaf of ideals", "target_term": "理想层"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent sheaf of ideals", "target_term": "拟凝聚理想层"}, {"source_term": "closed subspace", "target_term": "闭子空间"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "闭浸入的靶"}, {"source_term": "locally ringed spaces", "target_term": "局部环化空间", "context": "闭浸入所处的范畴"}, {"source_term": "closed immersion", "target_term": "闭浸入", "context": "引理的假设"}, {"source_term": "locally ringed space", "target_term": "局部环化空间", "context": "将证明为概形的对象"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "第一项结论"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射", "context": "取核的映射"}, {"source_term": "kernel", "target_term": "核", "context": "第二项结论所考察的对象"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent sheaf of ideals", "target_term": "拟凝聚理想层", "context": "第二项结论所得的性质"}, {"source_term": "affine open", "target_term": "仿射开集", "context": "第三项结论所量化的开集"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "第三项结论中待识别的态射"}, {"source_term": "ideal", "target_term": "理想", "context": "第三项结论中存在的理想"}, {"source_term": "locally generated by sections", "target_term": "局部由截面生成", "context": "与拟凝聚性等价的条件"}, {"source_term": "sheaf of ideals", "target_term": "理想层", "context": "等价关系适用的对象"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent sheaf of ideals", "target_term": "拟凝聚理想层", "context": "等价关系的另一侧"}, {"source_term": "closed subspace", "target_term": "闭子空间", "context": "最后一项推论所量化的对象"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "最后一项推论的性质"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:01IN:proof", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>为闭浸入（closed immersion）。设<MATH_0002>为一点（point）。任取一个仿射开集（affine open）邻域（neighbourhood）<MATH_0003>。设<MATH_0004>。由引理<REF_0001>可知，<MATH_0005>可与仿射概形（affine schemes）之间的态射（morphism）<MATH_0006>相识别。首先，这意味着<MATH_0007>是<MATH_0008>的仿射（affine）邻域（neighbourhood）。因此<MATH_0009>是概形（scheme）。其次，这意味着<MATH_0010>是<MATH_0011>。换言之，每一点（point）<MATH_0012>都有一个开（open）邻域（neighbourhood），使得<MATH_0013>在该邻域（neighbourhood）上是拟凝聚的（quasi-coherent）。注意<MATH_0014>。因此，理想层（sheaf of ideals）的限制（restriction）在<MATH_0015>上也是拟凝聚的（quasi-coherent）。由此得出，<MATH_0016>是拟凝聚的（quasi-coherent）。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "closed immersion", "target_term": "闭浸入"}, {"source_term": "point", "target_term": "点"}, {"source_term": "affine open", "target_term": "仿射开集"}, {"source_term": "neighbourhood", "target_term": "邻域"}, {"source_term": "affine schemes", "target_term": "仿射概形"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "affine", "target_term": "仿射"}, {"source_term": "neighbourhood", "target_term": "邻域"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "point", "target_term": "点"}, {"source_term": "open", "target_term": "开"}, {"source_term": "neighbourhood", "target_term": "邻域"}, {"source_term": "neighbourhood", "target_term": "邻域"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent", "target_term": "拟凝聚的"}, {"source_term": "sheaf of ideals", "target_term": "理想层"}, {"source_term": "restriction", "target_term": "限制"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent", "target_term": "拟凝聚的"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent", "target_term": "拟凝聚的"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "closed immersion", "target_term": "闭浸入", "context": "证明固定的态射"}, {"source_term": "point", "target_term": "点", "context": "证明选取的点"}, {"source_term": "affine open", "target_term": "仿射开集", "context": "所选邻域的类别"}, {"source_term": "neighbourhood", "target_term": "邻域", "context": "所选开集相对给定点的性质"}, {"source_term": "affine schemes", "target_term": "仿射概形", "context": 