{"unit_id": "tag:01IO:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>为概形（scheme）。\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002>概形（schemes）之间的态射（morphism）称为<TEXTITOPEN_0001>开浸入（open immersion）<TEXTITCLOSE_0001>，如果它是局部环化空间（locally ringed spaces）的开浸入（open immersion）（见定义<REF_0001>）。\n<STRUCT_0003><TEXTITOPEN_0002>开子概形（open subscheme）<TEXTITCLOSE_0002>（指<MATH_0002>的）是<MATH_0003>的开子空间（open subspace），含义见定义<REF_0002>。<MATH_0004>的开子概形（open subscheme）是概形（scheme），见引理<REF_0003>。\n<STRUCT_0004>概形（schemes）之间的态射（morphism）称为<TEXTITOPEN_0003>闭浸入（closed immersion）<TEXTITCLOSE_0003>，如果它是局部环化空间（locally ringed spaces）的闭浸入（closed immersion）（见定义<REF_0004>）。\n<STRUCT_0005><TEXTITOPEN_0004>闭子概形（closed subscheme）<TEXTITCLOSE_0004>（指<MATH_0005>的）是<MATH_0006>的闭子空间（closed subspace），含义见定义<REF_0005>。闭子概形（closed subscheme）是概形（scheme），见引理<REF_0006>。\n<STRUCT_0006>概形（schemes）之间的态射（morphism）<MATH_0007>称为<TEXTITOPEN_0005>浸入（immersion）<TEXTITCLOSE_0005>，或<TEXTITOPEN_0006>局部闭浸入（locally closed immersion）<TEXTITCLOSE_0006>，如果它可以分解为<MATH_0008>，其中<MATH_0009>为闭浸入（closed immersion），<MATH_0010>为开浸入（open immersion）。\n<STRUCT_0007>\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "open immersion", "target_term": "开浸入"}, {"source_term": "locally ringed spaces", "target_term": "局部环化空间"}, {"source_term": "open immersion", "target_term": "开浸入"}, {"source_term": "open subscheme", "target_term": "开子概形"}, {"source_term": "open subspace", "target_term": "开子空间"}, {"source_term": "open subscheme", "target_term": "开子概形"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "closed immersion", "target_term": "闭浸入"}, {"source_term": "locally ringed spaces", "target_term": "局部环化空间"}, {"source_term": "closed immersion", "target_term": "闭浸入"}, {"source_term": "closed subscheme", "target_term": "闭子概形"}, {"source_term": "closed subspace", "target_term": "闭子空间"}, {"source_term": "closed subscheme", "target_term": "闭子概形"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "immersion", "target_term": "浸入"}, {"source_term": "locally closed immersion", "target_term": "局部闭浸入"}, {"source_term": "closed immersion", "target_term": "闭浸入"}, {"source_term": "open immersion", "target_term": "开浸入"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "定义中给定的对象"}, {"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形", "context": "第一项中态射的两端"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "第一项中被命名的态射"}, {"source_term": "open immersion", "target_term": "开浸入", "context": "第一项定义的术语"}, {"source_term": "locally ringed spaces", "target_term": "局部环化空间", "context": "第一项判据所用的对象"}, {"source_term": "open immersion", "target_term": "开浸入", "context": "第一项所依据的已有概念"}, {"source_term": "open subscheme", "target_term": "开子概形", "context": "第二项定义的术语"}, {"source_term": "open subspace", "target_term": "开子空间", "context": "第二项所依据的已有概念"}, {"source_term": "open subscheme", "target_term": "开子概形", "context": "第二项引用引理的对象"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "第二项得到的结构"}, {"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形", "context": "第三项中态射的两端"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "第三项中被命名的态射"}, {"source_term": "closed immersion", "target_term": "闭浸入", "context": "第三项定义的术语"}, {"source_term": "locally ringed spaces", "target_term": "局部环化空间", "context": "第三项判据所用的对象"}, {"source_term": "closed immersion", "target_term": "闭浸入", "context": "第三项所依据的已有概念"}, {"source_term": "closed subscheme", "target_term": "闭子概形", "context": "第四项定义的术语"}, {"source_term": "closed subspace", "target_term": "闭子空间", "context": "第四项所依据的已有概念"}, {"source_term": "closed subscheme", "target_term": "闭子概形", "context": "第四项引用引理的对象"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "第四项得到的结构"}, {"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形", "context": "最后一项中态射的两端"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "最后一项中被命名的态射"}, {"source_term": "immersion", "target_term": "浸入", "context": "最后一项的第一个术语"}, {"source_term": "locally closed immersion", "target_term": "局部闭浸入", "context": "最后一项的另一术语"}, {"source_term": "closed immersion", "target_term": "闭浸入", "context": "分解中的第一个因子"}, {"source_term": "open immersion", "target_term": "开浸入", "context": "分解中的第二个因子"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:01IM:prose-0002", "translation": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n由第<REF_0001>节和第<REF_0002>节中的引理可知，概形（schemes）的任意开（open）（分别为<SPACE_0001>闭（closed））浸入（immersion）都与其靶（target）中的某个开（open）（分别为<SPACE_0002>闭（closed））子概形（subscheme）的包含映射（inclusion）同构（isomorphic）。\n\n<STRUCT_0002><STRUCT_0003>\n我们对闭浸入（closed immersion）的定义介于 Hartshorne 与 EGA 的定义之间。Hartshorne 将闭浸入（closed immersion）定义为满足下述条件的概形（schemes）态射（morphism）<MATH_0001>：它诱导将<MATH_0002>映到<MATH_0003>的某个闭子集（closed subset）上的同胚（homeomorphism），并且<MATH_0004>是满射（surjective），见<REF_0003>。我们将在引理<REF_0004>中证明这与我们的定义等价（equivalent）。在<REF_0005>中，Grothendieck 和 Dieudonn<ACCENT_0001>先通过例<REF_0006>的构造，使用拟凝聚层（quasi-coherent sheaves）（由理想（ideals）组成）来定义闭子概形（closed subschemes），然后把闭浸入（closed immersion）定义为这样的态射（morphism）<MATH_0005>，它诱导出与某个闭子概形（closed subscheme）的同构（isomorphism）。由引理<REF_0007>可知，这与我们的定义一致。\n\n<STRUCT_0004><STRUCT_0005>\n从教学的角度看，上述定义简直是一场灾难／噩梦。在给学生讲授这些内容时，我们发现，通常可以方便地把闭浸入（closed immersion）定义为满足下述条件的概形（schemes）之间的仿射（affine）态射（morphism）<MATH_0006>：<MATH_0007>是满射（surjective）。这是因为仿射（affine）态射（morphism）的概念（见态射（Morphisms）一章第<REF_0008>节）相当自然，也容易理解。\n\n<STRUCT_0006><STRUCT_0007>\n关于闭浸入（closed immersions）的更多信息，建议读者参阅态射（Morphisms）一章的第<REF_0009>节和第<REF_0010>节。\n\n<STRUCT_0008><STRUCT_0009>\n本节末尾将讨论局部（locally）闭子概形（closed subschemes）和浸入（immersions）。\n\n", "allowed_english": ["Hartshorne", "EGA", "Grothendieck", "Dieudonn"], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "open", "target_term": "开"}, {"source_term": "closed", "target_term": "闭"}, {"source_term": "immersion", "target_term": "浸入"}, {"source_term": "target", "target_term": "靶"}, {"source_term": "open", "target_term": "开"}, {"source_term": "closed", "target_term": "闭"}, {"source_term": "subscheme", "target_term": "子概形"}, {"source_term": "inclusion", "target_term": "包含映射"}, {"source_term": "isomorphic", "target_term": "同构"}, {"source_term": "closed immersion", "target_term": "闭浸入"}, {"source_term": "closed immersion", "target_term": "闭浸入"}, {"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "closed subset", "target_term": "闭子集"}, {"source_term": "homeomorphism", "target_term": "同胚"}, {"source_term": "surjective", "target_term": "满射"}, {"source_term": "equivalent", "target_term": "等价"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent sheaves", "target_term": "拟凝聚层"}, {"source_term": "ideals", "target_term": "理想"}, {"source_term": "closed subschemes", "target_term": "闭子概形"}, {"source_term": "closed immersion", "target_term": "闭浸入"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "closed subscheme", "target_term": "闭子概形"}, {"source_term": "isomorphism", "target_term": "同构"}, {"source_term": "closed immersion", "target_term": "闭浸入"}, {"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "affine", "target_term": "仿射"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "surjective", "target_term": "满射"}, {"source_term": "affine", "target_term": "仿射"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "Morphisms", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "closed immersions", "target_term": "闭浸入"}, {"source_term": "Morphisms", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "locally", "target_term": "局部"}, {"source_term": "closed subschemes", "target_term": "闭子概形"}, {"source_term": "immersions", "target_term": "浸入"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形", "context": "浸入所涉及的对象"}, {"source_term": "open", "target_term": "开", "context": "第一类浸入的修饰语"}, {"source_term": "closed", "target_term": "闭", "context": "第二类浸入的修饰语"}, {"source_term": "immersion", "target_term": "浸入", "context": "段首先比较的态射类型"}, {"source_term": "target", "target_term": "靶", "context": "包含映射的目标对象"}, {"source_term": "open", "target_term": "开", "context": "第一类子概形的修饰语"}, {"source_term": "closed", "target_term": "闭", "context": "第二类子概形的修饰语"}, {"source_term": "subscheme", "target_term": "子概形", "context": "包含映射的来源"}, {"source_term": "inclusion", "target_term": "包含映射", "context": "与浸入同构的态射"}, {"source_term": "isomorphic", "target_term": "同构", "context": "浸入与包含映射的关系"}, {"source_term": "closed immersion", "target_term": "闭浸入", "context": "比较的定义"}, {"source_term": "closed immersion", "target_term": "闭浸入", "context": "Hartshorne 所定义的类型"}, {"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形", "context": "Hartshorne 定义里态射的对象"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "Hartshorne 定义的基本对象"}, {"source_term": "closed subset", "target_term": "闭子集", "context": "诱导同胚的像"}, {"source_term": "homeomorphism", "target_term": "同胚", "context": "Hartshorne 定义的第一个条件"}, {"source_term": "surjective", "target_term": "满射", "context": "Hartshorne 定义的满性条件"}, {"source_term": "equivalent", "target_term": "等价", "context": "两个定义之间的关系"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent sheaves", "target_term": "拟凝聚层", "context": "构造闭子概形所用的层"}, {"source_term": "ideals", "target_term": "理想", "context": "拟凝聚层所涉及的理想"}, {"source_term": "closed subschemes", "target_term": "闭子概形", "context": "所引文献先定义的对象"}, {"source_term": "closed immersion", "target_term": "闭浸入", "context": "所引文献随后定义的态射类型"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "所引文献定义所用的态射"}, {"source_term": "closed subscheme", "target_term": "闭子概形", "context": "与源同构的对象"}, {"source_term": "isomorphism", "target_term": "同构", "context": "态射诱导的同构"}, {"source_term": "closed immersion", "target_term": "闭浸入", "context": "教学场景中定义的术语"}, {"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形", "context": "教学定义中态射的两端"}, {"source_term": "affine", "target_term": "仿射", "context": "教学定义中所要求的态射性质"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "教学定义所用的态射"}, {"source_term": "surjective", "target_term": "满射", "context": "教学定义所要求的满性"}, {"source_term": "affine", "target_term": "仿射", "context": "所引概念的修饰语"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "所引概念的基本对象"}, {"source_term": "Morphisms", "target_term": "态射", "context": "第一次所引章节名称"}, {"source_term": "closed immersions", "target_term": "闭浸入", "context": "所推荐阅读的主题"}, {"source_term": "Morphisms", "target_term": "态射", "context": "第二次所引章节名称"}, {"source_term": "locally", "target_term": "局部", "context": "修饰本节末尾讨论的闭子概形"}, {"source_term": "closed subschemes", "target_term": "闭子概形", "context": "本节末尾将讨论的对象"}, {"source_term": "immersions", "target_term": "浸入", "context": "本节末尾将讨论的态射"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:01IP:statement", "translation": "若<MATH_0001>是概形（schemes）的浸入（immersion），则一般不能把<MATH_0002>分解为先作开浸入（open immersion）再作闭浸入（closed immersion）。见态射（Morphisms）一章的例<REF_0001>。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "immersion", "target_term": "浸入"}, {"source_term": "open immersion", "target_term": "开浸入"}, {"source_term": "closed immersion", "target_term": "闭浸入"}, {"source_term": "Morphisms", "target_term": "态射"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形", "context": "浸入所处的范畴"}, {"source_term": "immersion", "target_term": "浸入", "context": "注记给定的态射类型"}, {"source_term": "open immersion", "target_term": "开浸入", "context": "所讨论分解的第一个因子"}, {"source_term": "closed immersion", "target_term": "闭浸入", "context": "所讨论分解的第二个因子"}, {"source_term": "Morphisms", "target_term": "态射", "context": "所引章节名称"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:01IQ:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>为概形（schemes）的浸入（immersion）。则<MATH_0002>是闭浸入（closed immersion）当且仅当<MATH_0003>是闭子集（closed subset）。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "immersion", "target_term": "浸入"}, {"source_term": "closed immersion", "target_term": "闭浸入"}, {"source_term": "closed subset", "target_term": "闭子集"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形", "context": "浸入所处的范畴"}, {"source_term": "immersion", "target_term": "浸入", "context": "引理所考察的态射"}, {"source_term": "closed immersion", "target_term": "闭浸入", "context": "等价判据的第一侧"}, {"source_term": "closed subset", "target_term": "闭子集", "context": "等价判据的第二侧"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:01IQ:proof", "translation": "若<MATH_0001>是闭浸入（closed immersion），则按定义<MATH_0002>是闭的（closed）。反之，设<MATH_0003>是闭的（closed）。按定义，存在开子概形（open subscheme）<MATH_0004>，使得<MATH_0005>是闭浸入（closed immersion）<MATH_0006>与开浸入（open immersion）<MATH_0007>的复合（composition）。设<MATH_0008>为与闭浸入（closed immersion）<MATH_0009>关联的拟凝聚理想层（quasi-coherent sheaf of ideals）。注意<MATH_0010>。因此，可以粘合（glue）（见层（Sheaves）一章第<REF_0001>节）<MATH_0011>与<MATH_0012>，得到理想层（sheaf of ideals）<MATH_0013>。由于<MATH_0014>的每一点（point）都有一个邻域（neighbourhood），使得<MATH_0015>在其中是拟凝聚的（quasi-coherent），可知<MATH_0016>是拟凝聚的（quasi-coherent）（特别地，它局部由截面生成（locally generated by sections））。按构造，<MATH_0017>支撑于（supported on）<MATH_0018>，且限制到（restricted）那里便等于<MATH_0019>。因此，与<MATH_0020>和<MATH_0021>关联的闭子空间（closed subspaces）典范同构（canonically isomorphic），见例<REF_0002>。特别地，<MATH_0022>中与<MATH_0023>关联的闭子空间（closed subspace）同构（isomorphic）于<MATH_0024>的某个闭子空间（closed subspace）。由于<MATH_0025>与<MATH_0026>所确定的闭子空间（closed subspace）相识别，见引理<REF_0003>，可知<MATH_0027>是闭浸入（closed immersion）。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "closed immersion", "target_term": "闭浸入"}, {"source_term": "closed", "target_term": "闭的"}, {"source_term": "closed", "target_term": "闭的"}, {"source_term": "open subscheme", "target_term": "开子概形"}, {"source_term": "closed immersion", "target_term": "闭浸入"}, {"source_term": "open immersion", "target_term": "开浸入"}, {"source_term": "composition", "target_term": "复合"}, {"source_term": "closed immersion", "target_term": "闭浸入"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent sheaf of ideals", "target_term": "拟凝聚理想层"}, {"source_term": "glue", "target_term": "粘合"}, {"source_term": "Sheaves", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "sheaf of ideals", "target_term": "理想层"}, {"source_term": "point", "target_term": "点"}, {"source_term": "neighbourhood", "target_term": "邻域"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent", "target_term": "拟凝聚的"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent", "target_term": "拟凝聚的"}, {"source_term": "locally generated by sections", "target_term": "局部由截面生成"}, {"source_term": "supported on", "target_term": "支撑于"}, {"source_term": "restricted", "target_term": "限制到"}, {"source_term": "closed subspaces", "target_term": "闭子空间"}, {"source_term": "canonically isomorphic", "target_term": "典范同构"}, {"source_term": "closed subspace", "target_term": "闭子空间"}, {"source_term": "isomorphic", "target_term": "同构"}, {"source_term": "closed subspace", "target_term": "闭子空间"}, {"source_term": "closed subspace", "target_term": "闭子空间"}, {"source_term": "closed immersion", "target_term": "闭浸入"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "closed immersion", "target_term": "闭浸入", "context": "正向蕴含的假设"}, {"source_term": "closed", "target_term": "闭的", "context": "正向蕴含的结论"}, {"source_term": "closed", "target_term": "闭的", "context": "反向蕴含的假设"}, {"source_term": "open subscheme", "target_term": "开子概形", "context": "反向证明中存在的子概形"}, {"source_term": "closed immersion", "target_term": "闭浸入", "context": "复合的第一个因子"}, {"source_term": "open immersion", "target_term": "开浸入", "context": "复合的第二个因子"}, {"source_term": "composition", "target_term": "复合", "context": "表示给定态射的运算"}, {"source_term": "closed immersion", "target_term": "闭浸入", "context": "提供理想层的态射"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent sheaf of ideals", "target_term": "拟凝聚理想层", "context": "与给定闭浸入关联的层"}, {"source_term": "glue", "target_term": "粘合", "context": "由两个局部对象构造整体"}, {"source_term": "Sheaves", "target_term": "层", "context": "所引章节名称"}, {"source_term": "sheaf of ideals", "target_term": "理想层", "context": "粘合所得的对象"}, {"source_term": "point", "target_term": "点", "context": "局部性质所量化的对象"}, {"source_term": "neighbourhood", "target_term": "邻域", "context": "每一点处保证拟凝聚性的范围"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent", "target_term": "拟凝聚的", "context": "局部满足的性质"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent", "target_term": "拟凝聚的", "context": "由局部条件推出的性质"}, {"source_term": "locally generated by sections", "target_term": "局部由截面生成", "context": "拟凝聚性在此给出的性质"}, {"source_term": "supported on", "target_term": "支撑于", "context": "所构造的层与其支撑范围的关系"}, {"source_term": "restricted", "target_term": "限制到", "context": "在所指范围内取限制"}, {"source_term": "closed subspaces", "target_term": "闭子空间", "context": "通过典范同构比较的两个子空间"}, {"source_term": "canonically isomorphic", "target_term": "典范同构", "context": "两个闭子空间的关系"}, {"source_term": "closed subspace", "target_term": "闭子空间", "context": "两个同构对象中的前者"}, {"source_term": "isomorphic", "target_term": "同构", "context": "两个闭子空间之间的关系"}, {"source_term": "closed subspace", "target_term": "闭子空间", "context": "两个同构对象中的后者"}, {"source_term": "closed subspace", "target_term": "闭子空间", "context": "结论前进行识别的对象"}, {"source_term": "closed immersion", "target_term": "闭浸入", "context": "反向蕴含的结论"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:01IM:prose-0003", "translation": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n设<MATH_0001>为浸入（immersion）。设<MATH_0002>，它是<MATH_0003>的闭子集（closed subset）。设<MATH_0004>。该引理说明，<MATH_0005>是<MATH_0006>满足下述条件的最大开子空间（open subspace）：<MATH_0007>经由到<MATH_0008>的闭浸入（closed immersion）分解（factors through）。我们把<TEXTITOPEN_0001>局部闭子概形（locally closed subscheme）（指<MATH_0009>的）<TEXTITCLOSE_0001>定义为一个二元组（pair）<MATH_0010>，由闭子概形（closed subscheme）<MATH_0011>及开子概形（open subscheme）<MATH_0012>构成，前者是后者的子概形，后者是<MATH_0013>的子概形，并且还满足<MATH_0014>。我们通常只说“设<MATH_0015>是局部闭子概形（locally closed subscheme），它是<MATH_0016>的”，因为可以恢复<MATH_0017>，所用的态射（morphism）是<MATH_0018>。由上可见，任意浸入（immersion）<MATH_0019>均可唯一分解（factors）为<MATH_0020>，其中<MATH_0021>是<MATH_0022>的局部闭子空间（locally closed subspace），且<MATH_0023>是同构（isomorphism）。\n\n<STRUCT_0002><STRUCT_0003>\n这样做的意义在于，局部（locally）闭子概形（closed subschemes）的全体（collection）（指<MATH_0024>的）构成一个集合（set）。可以在这个集合（set）上定义一个偏序（partial ordering），出于显然的理由，我们称之为包含（inclusion）。具体而言，若<MATH_0025>和<MATH_0026>是<MATH_0027>的两个局部（locally）闭子概形（closed subschemes），则称<TEXTITOPEN_0002><MATH_0028>包含于（is contained）<MATH_0029><TEXTITCLOSE_0002>的条件就是态射（morphism）<MATH_0030>经由<MATH_0031>分解（factors through）。若确能如此分解，则当然可将<MATH_0032>与<MATH_0033>的唯一一个局部闭子概形（locally closed subscheme）相识别，等等。\n\n<STRUCT_0004><STRUCT_0005>\n关于浸入（immersions）的更多信息，请参阅态射（Morphisms）一章第<REF_0001>节。\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "immersion", "target_term": "浸入"}, {"source_term": "closed subset", "target_term": "闭子集"}, {"source_term": "open subspace", "target_term": "开子空间"}, {"source_term": "closed immersion", "target_term": "闭浸入"}, {"source_term": "factors through", "target_term": "分解"}, {"source_term": "locally closed subscheme", "target_term": "局部闭子概形"}, {"source_term": "pair", "target_term": "二元组"}, {"source_term": "closed subscheme", "target_term": "闭子概形"}, {"source_term": "open subscheme", "target_term": "开子概形"}, {"source_term": "locally closed subscheme", "target_term": "局部闭子概形"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "immersion", "target_term": "浸入"}, {"source_term": "factors", "target_term": "分解"}, {"source_term": "locally closed subspace", "target_term": "局部闭子空间"}, {"source_term": "isomorphism", "target_term": "同构"}, {"source_term": "locally", "target_term": "局部"}, {"source_term": "closed subschemes", "target_term": "闭子概形"}, {"source_term": "collection", "target_term": "全体"}, {"source_term": "set", "target_term": "集合"}, {"source_term": "set", "target_term": "集合"}, {"source_term": "partial ordering", "target_term": "偏序"}, {"source_term": "inclusion", "target_term": "包含"}, {"source_term": "locally", "target_term": "局部"}, {"source_term": "closed subschemes", "target_term": "闭子概形"}, {"source_term": "is contained", "target_term": "包含于"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "factors through", "target_term": "分解"}, {"source_term": "locally closed subscheme", "target_term": "局部闭子概形"}, {"source_term": "immersions", "target_term": "浸入"}, {"source_term": "Morphisms", "target_term": "态射"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "immersion", "target_term": "浸入", "context": "段落最初给定的态射"}, {"source_term": "closed subset", "target_term": "闭子集", "context": "对所设对象的描述"}, {"source_term": "open subspace", "target_term": "开子空间", "context": "最大性涉及的子空间类型"}, {"source_term": "closed immersion", "target_term": "闭浸入", "context": "所要求的分解因子"}, {"source_term": "factors through", "target_term": "分解", "context": "最大开子空间应满足的条件"}, {"source_term": "locally closed subscheme", "target_term": "局部闭子概形", "context": "此处定义的对象"}, {"source_term": "pair", "target_term": "二元组", "context": "定义所用的数据"}, {"source_term": "closed subscheme", "target_term": "闭子概形", "context": "二元组中的第一个对象"}, {"source_term": "open subscheme", "target_term": "开子概形", "context": "二元组中的第二个对象"}, {"source_term": "locally closed subscheme", "target_term": "局部闭子概形", "context": "通常使用的简称"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "恢复另一对象所用的态射"}, {"source_term": "i